# Intentionally variable-free. `cf-typegen` passes this file to
# `wrangler types --env-file` so type generation reads ONLY the committed
# wrangler.jsonc: without it wrangler folds the gitignored `.dev.vars` into
# `Cloudflare.Env`, so the generated file would differ per developer — and from
# CI, which has no `.dev.vars` — breaking the drift check.
#
# Local dev secrets still live in `.dev.vars` (`wrangler dev` loads it as
# usual); they are typed in worker.ts via `AuthEnv`. Keep this file empty of
# variables.
